        <mxCell id="vXT19Y04ME3kIjo5FyuG-9" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Georgia&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;449&quot; data-start=&quot;440&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;4 -&amp;gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;The Payment History service consumes the event and persists the data in the database, with the tables listed below&lt;/font&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot; face=&quot;Georgia&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;align=left;" parent="vXT19Y04ME3kIjo5FyuG-8" vertex="1">
